{"headword":"רִנָּה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. ringing cry</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.16\">Je 7:16</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִנָּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:1\" href=\"/Psalms.17.1\">ψ 17:1</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">רִנָּתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.12\">Je 14:12</a> +;—<em>ringing cry:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"in entreaty, supplication, to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.28\">1 K 8:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.19\">2 Ch 6:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.16\">Je 7:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.14\">11:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:1\" href=\"/Psalms.17.1\">ψ 17:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:2\" href=\"/Psalms.61.2\">61:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:3\" href=\"/Psalms.88.3\">88:3</a> (all + <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפִלָּה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:44\" href=\"/Psalms.106.44\">106:44</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:169\" href=\"/Psalms.119.169\">119:169</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 142:7\" href=\"/Psalms.142.7\">142:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.12\">Je 14:12</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"in proclamation <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.36\">1 K 22:36</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"in joy, especially praise to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְחָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.10\">Is 35:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.11\">51:11</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂשׂוֹן</span>); + <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּהִלָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.22\">2 Ch 20:22</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂשׂוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:43\" href=\"/Psalms.105.43\">ψ 105:43</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹדָה</spa